# Team runtime workspace

## Ephemeral run state — never track handoffs, checkpoints, proposals
.team/*

## Federation durable state — TRACKED (survives clones; versioned history)
!.team/federation/
.team/federation/*
!.team/federation/registry.md
!.team/federation/decisions.md
!.team/federation/changelog.md
!.team/federation/releases/
!.team/federation/releases/**
!.team/federation/conflicts/
!.team/federation/conflicts/**

## Federation staging — ignored (read-only copies, per-project snapshot bloat)
.team/federation/inbox/
.team/federation/catalog/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
